Sound
- All sound effects are synthesised in code (numpy / scipy) by mix.py and core/audio/sfx.py. No samples, no music, no voice.

Pictures
- Everything is drawn in code (Canvas 2D). No photos, stock footage or generated video.

Facts
- Sources for every health statement are listed in FACTS.md (WHO 2020 guidelines; Ekelund et al., Lancet 2016; studies on sitting and lower-leg swelling).
